EXPLANATORY NOTE
As used in this Annual Report on Form 10-K, unless otherwise indicated or the context otherwise requires, references to:
● “Lakeside,” “the Company,” “we,” “us,” and “our” refer to Lakeside Holding Limited together with its consolidated subsidiaries;
● “ABL” refer to American Bear Logistics Corp.
● “Sichuan Hupan” refer to Sichuan Hupan Jincheng Enterprise Management Co., Ltd., a PRC limited liability company in China and a wholly owned subsidiary of Lakeside;
● “Hupan Pharmaceutical” refer to Hupan Pharmaceutical (Hubei) Co., Ltd., a PRC limited liability company in China and a wholly owned subsidiary of Sichuan Hupan;
● “RMB” and “Renminbi” refer to the legal currency of China;
● “US$,” “U.S. dollars,” “$,” and “dollars” refer to the legal currency of the United States.
